# PostHog (House36 Default project) — public client project API key.
# Inlined at `astro build` via import.meta.env.PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY.
#
# Local: copy to `.env` (gitignored) and paste the project API key.
# Vercel (live frontend): Project Settings → Environment Variables →
#   PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY for Production and Preview. Redeploy after adding.
# Cloudflare Pages / wrangler.jsonc `vars`: only needed if you also build the
#   Astro site on Cloudflare. Runtime Worker/Pages Function vars do NOT populate
#   import.meta.env unless the same name is present at build time.
PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=
PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com
